      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z",
      "text": "In association football, CD Tenerife striker Jesús de Miguel dies following an in-game collision with FC Andorra goalkeeper Jesús Owono the previous day.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-03:12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:09Z",
      "text": "Jesús de Miguel Alameda was born on 21 September 1996 in Madrid.",
